WEBVTT

00:03:57.616 --> 00:04:00.473
don’t have a matched family member.

00:04:00.473 --> 00:04:03.403
Those patients 
turn to donor registries of volunteers

00:04:03.403 --> 00:04:05.883
willing to offer their bone marrow.

00:04:05.883 --> 00:04:10.193
All it takes to be on the registry is 
a cheek swab to test for a genetic match.

00:04:10.193 --> 00:04:12.452
And in many cases, 
the donation itself

00:04:12.452 --> 00:04:15.423
isn’t much more complicated 
than giving blood.

00:04:15.423 --> 00:04:17.293
It’s a way to save someone’s life

00:04:17.293 --> 00:04:20.163
with a resource 
that’s completely renewable.